-- title:
--   Crossing model as a quadratic algebra over D[[s]]
-- statement:
--   Let $W$ be a commutative ring and $c \in W$. Write $D = W[\![t]\!]/(t - \bar c)$ for the quotient of `PowerSeries W` by the ideal generated by $\mathrm{X} - \mathrm{C}(c)$, and $B = D[\![s]\!]$ for the power series ring over $D$; let $\gamma \in B$ denote the constant series whose coefficient is the class in $D$ of the constant series $\mathrm{C}(c)$, and for $w \in W$ let $\gamma_w \in B$ be the constant series whose coefficient is the class of $\mathrm{C}(w)$. The assertion is that the crossing model $\mathrm{UVCrossingModel}\;W\;c$, that is the quotient of the two-variable power series ring $\mathrm{MvPowerSeries}\,(\mathrm{Fin}\,2)\,W$ by the ideal generated by $\mathrm{X}_0\mathrm{X}_1 - \mathrm{C}(c)$, admits a ring isomorphism $e$ onto $B[X]/(X^2 - \mathrm{C}(s)\,X + \mathrm{C}(\gamma))$, presented as `AdjoinRoot` of that quadratic polynomial, such that $e$ carries the distinguished element `U c` to the class of $X$ (the adjoined root), carries `S c` to the image of $s$ under the structure map $B \to B[X]/(X^2 - sX + \gamma)$, and carries, for every $w \in W$, the constant $\mathrm{const}\;c\;w$, i.e. the class of $\mathrm{C}(w)$, to the image of $\gamma_w$. No hypotheses are imposed on $W$ or on $c$.
--
--   This identifies the local crossing model $W[\![u,v]\!]/(uv - c)$, the standard model of a modular curve along a crossing of two branches, as a free quadratic algebra of rank two generated by $u$ over a one-variable power series ring in the symmetric coordinate $u + v$, with relation $u^2 - (u+v)u + c = 0$. It is used in the analysis of divisibility and units in the crossing model and in the proof that the model is integrally closed when $c$ is a power of a uniformizer.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_UVCrossingModel_exists_ringEquiv_adjoinRoot.lean

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_ModularCurve_UVCrossingModel

set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000
set_option synthInstance.maxHeartbeats 400000
